gow2-recomp - Gears of War 2 PC port (static recompilation)

This program is free software distributed under the terms of the GNU
General Public License, version 3 (see LICENSE). The repository contains no
game material (ISO, XEX, assets, recompiled code).

It contains code derived from or adapted from the projects listed below.
Every copied or adapted file states in its header the origin project, the
original path, the reference commit and the license. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
lists every third-party component, including the ones only used at runtime
or at build time.

